{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1761905032\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1761905032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1761905032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET ROXANNE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't just steal gold and artifacts, she steals hearts... only to break them without mercy. Roxanne is a master of sweet words and wicked touches. Her whisper is a velvet poison that wraps around your will and bends it effortlessly. She sings love songs, promises eternal devotion and paradise... But by morning, you'll be left without your pants, your wallet, your house keys and your faith in humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roxanne knows exactly what you crave... and she's not shy about using it. In bed, she's a devious seductress\u2014the kind who loves to bind, tease, and push you right to the edge, only to vanish into the morning mist. Just remember: when you think you've got a hold on her, it's actually her holding you... by something very, very sensitive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1761905032\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Roxanne as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1761905032\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916490?t=1761905032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916490?t=1761905032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/3db250fedbff077217702ae9e58b0806dff0ff8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761905032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/3db250fedbff077217702ae9e58b0806dff0ff8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761905032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old.\r\nThis DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916490/ex